THIRD-PARTY FONT SOFTWARE - NOT COVERED BY THE LICENSE ABOVE

The file theme.css contains four typefaces embedded as base64-encoded woff2
Font Software: Bricolage Grotesque, Instrument Sans, Spline Sans Mono and
Caveat.

That Font Software is not part of the licensed material above. It is
licensed separately and exclusively under the SIL Open Font License, Version
1.1, it retains the copyright of its respective authors, and it is neither
relicensed nor sublicensed by this file. Nothing in the license above
grants or implies any permission to sell, sublicense or redistribute the Font
Software by itself, and no such permission is available from this project.

Each typeface's copyright notice and the full text of the SIL Open Font
License, Version 1.1 are reproduced in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md and in the
header comment of theme.css.
